cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Swarm Tales or a run recorded with it, please cite it as below; cite a line of a run's log by its #seq."
type: software
title: "Swarm Tales"
abstract: "A laboratory for AI agents: games and societies on one engine, every word and every private thought on record. A run has a seeded world and a signed, hash-chained log, so it can be cited line by line."
